WEBVTT

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.540
<b>Self-Study!!</b>

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:10.790
Hey, Nishikata.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:13.420
Whatcha doing?

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:16.000
What is that?

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:19.500
Just a little something I bought yesterday.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.210
Take a good look, Takagi-san!

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:24.630
This is the cool grip strength thingy the
guys in athletic clubs always use!

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:26.380
Bet you're jealous.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.830
Wow. That's neat!

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.330
It's so compact, you can use it anywhere.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.420
You got that right!

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:35.790
So, what are you training your grip strength for?

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:39.630
You're not in any athletic club. So what's the point?

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:42.630
Let me guess.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.630
You're just doing it because it's cool.

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:46.670
No freaking way!

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:48.210
Don't be ridiculous!

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.830
There's a ton of things I can do with good grip strength!

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:53.130
Oh? Like what?

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:54.500
Uh...

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.830
Opening bottle tops!

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:58.460
Why not just use a bottle opener?

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:00.790
Hanging on for long periods of time.

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:01.710
From where?

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:04.500
Crushing apples...

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.500
What for?

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:08.460
Anyway, those are just a few examples.

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:11.710
By the way.

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:14.960
You stopped training.

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:53.000
<b>The Grip Strength Thingy</b>

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.500
The Grip Strength Thingy!

00:02:56.540 --> 00:03:00.290
One, two... One, two...

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:02.290
One, two...

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:03.960
What?
One...<b></b>

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:06.330
Just keeping a rhythm, that's all.

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:08.380
For my own amusement.

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:10.670
Uh, okay.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:17.330
One, two... One, two... One, two...

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:21.460
I know what you're up to, Takagi-san! This is a challenge!

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:26.500
I have to keep up with the pace that you set or I lose!

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:29.540
That's right, isn't it?!

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:30.790
However!

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:34.330
That takes a physical toll on me,
while Takagi-san does nothing but use her voice!

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:38.080
I'm at a huge disadvantage, no matter how you look at it!

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:42.380
One, two. One, two. One, two.

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:43.750
Her pace is getting...

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:45.750
even faster!

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:50.210
Ugh, my arm!

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:54.130
But at this rate,
Takagi-san shouldn't be able to keep going much longer!

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:56.880
She screwed up by not thinking this one through!

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.960
Gotta push through it!

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:03.670
One two, one two, one two, one two.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:07.460
One two, one two, one two, one two.

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:12.130
All done.

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:17.670
I won...

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:20.880
For once in my life... I defeated Takagi-san!

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:23.880
You really went hard!

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:24.960
Or not?!

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:26.040
Uh oh...

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:29.000
Maybe it wasn't even a challenge in the first place...

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:29.880
Hey.

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:36.960
I get it! This was her real plan all along!

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.630
Challenging me to a grip contest after wearing me out!

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:41.540
But it's not that easy, Takagi-san!

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:45.830
I'm more than a match for you, even when I'm tired!

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:54.500
Uh, Nishikata?

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:58.210
I just wanted you to let me try the grip strength thingy.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:01.750
W-wait a sec, I thought we were having a grip contest!

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:08.420
So you haven't had enough of holding my hand?

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:16.960
Wha?

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.130
WHAAAAAAA?!

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:24.920
H-how'd we get here?

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:27.380
Wait, Takagi-san?!

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:28.540
Takagi-san!

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:33.580
Takagi-san!

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:34.750
Takagi-san!

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:36.210
Hey, Nishikata.

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:40.250
Hey, Nishikata.

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:43.500
I'm over here, Nishikata.

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:45.210
Takagi-san!

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:02.250
Is the Takagi-san you're looking for...

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.380
this Takagi-san?

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:07.380
Or is it this Takagi-san?

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:09.710
Hey, Nishikata.

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.630
N-NEITHER!

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:13.000
Oh?

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.500
Then perhaps it's this Takagi-san?

00:06:15.670 --> 00:06:17.580
Or this Takagi-san?

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.080
Hey, Nishikata.

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:21.750
Hey, Nishikata!

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:25.290
Nishikata! Over this way!

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:27.670
What were you looking at?

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:28.960
KYUNKO?!

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:31.080
Please welcome our new transfer student!

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.670
Hey. How you doin'?

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.210
Squee!

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:42.380
Come closer, baby.

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:43.960
Whoa, hold on!

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:56.750
My hand is over here.

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:04.750
Moo! Nishikata!

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:07.500
Moo!

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:08.210
Darn her!
Moo!<b></b>

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:08.830
Darn her!

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:09.210
Moo!

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:10.130
She's taking this teasing thing way too far!
Moo!<b></b>

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:10.830
She's taking this teasing thing way too far!

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:11.920
She's taking this teasing thing way too far!
Moo!<b></b>

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:14.170
Takagi-san! Baaaah!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:18.920
Hey, Nishikata.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:23.040
Taking advantage of your opponent's weakness...

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:24.790
is unfair, wouldn't you say?

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:26.420
Even Dandy?!

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:31.170
It's called strategy.

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:34.920
Bang!

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:42.750
Ta... Takagi-saaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaan!

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:49.250
Takagi-san....

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:56.670
Oh crap! What about school?!

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:58.460
<b>August</b>

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:01.000
<b>Sunday</b>

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:01.000
<b>August 25th</b>

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:03.830
It's still... summer vacation...

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:10.750
I was using the grip strength thingy while doing
homework and then fell asleep, huh?

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:14.880
So, the whole thing was a dream...

00:08:18.420 --> 00:08:19.710
Wait a second!

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:26.290
Was the festival from yesterday a dream, too?!

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:39.540
Even in my dreams I can't escape
from Takagi-san's teasing!

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:46.290
<b>Tan</b>

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:44.750
Tan!

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:51.540
Hi!

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:55.500
Hi.

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:57.420
Haven't seen you since the festival.

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:00.790
It's been a while.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:02.790
Uh, really?

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:06.040
I mean, I just saw you in a dream...

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:07.710
Dream?

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:11.250
Oh fudge! I shouldn't have said that!

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:13.960
Wow. I'm honored!

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:15.170
What kind of dream?

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:19.170
D-dunno. I forgot it the instant I woke up.

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:20.880
Was it a naughty dream?

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:23.130
It most certainly was NOT!

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:25.580
Huh? But I thought you forgot what it was about.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:31.040
So, what'd you ask me here for?

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:33.210
You know school starts back up tomorrow.

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:39.290
Is it something urgent?

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:43.170
Before we get to that, are you free now?

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:45.750
Well, yeah.

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:46.630
Great.

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:48.830
Then, will you walk with me for a bit?

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:55.330
Today's the last day of summer vacation, huh?

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:57.080
Unfortunately, yeah.

00:09:57.250 --> 00:09:59.540
I wish it was a little longer.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.670
Did you enjoy the time off?

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:02.920
Oh, totally!

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:07.040
I went for a swim at the beach yesterday!
Check out my tan!

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:10.000
Whoa. That's impressive, Nishikata!

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:14.920
I went to the beach a few days ago myself,
but I didn't get much of a tan.

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:18.960
Uh-huh...

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:24.250
This is bad. I shouldn't have mentioned my tan.

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:29.830
If Takagi-san finds out I actually burned
my back and it stings, then...

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:31.630
Bam!

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:36.170
So, you got a little sunburnt!

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:38.250
She already figured it out!

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:41.830
C'mon, tough it out. I can't afford to back down!

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.420
Not at all!

00:10:46.420 --> 00:10:48.210
It doesn't hurt in the slightest!

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:49.500
Okay, one more pat on the back-

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.710
NO! I LIED! IT HURTS LIKE HELL!

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:58.460
Crap. I gotta do something. Sooner or later, she'll...

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:01.380
Are you thinking "sooner or later, she'll get me again"?

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:03.750
No.

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:05.920
It's written all over your face.

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:07.920
Okay, let's make a deal.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:12.170
Take a guess at the reason that
I called you out here today, Nishikata.

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:16.170
Get it right and I promise I won't touch your back again.

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:17.790
For real?

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:21.540
I already know that just saying I won't
touch it isn't enough to convince you.

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:27.210
So, I figured that it would be better for
you if we turned it into a competition.

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:29.670
That's true.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:32.380
Fine. You got a deal.

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:39.130
I got it.

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:41.330
To return the manga you borrowed from me!

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:44.960
Why'd you do that?

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:46.250
Because you got it wrong.

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:47.880
Since when did that become a rule?!

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:49.750
Oops. Did I forget to explain that part?

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:50.920
You didn't!

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:52.960
Well, now you know. Next guess.

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:56.790
Man, how stupid can I get?

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:58.750
All I had to do was look.

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:01.880
Takagi-san clearly didn't bring any manga with her.

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:19.540
Ugh, she's enjoying this.
Meanwhile, I'm in nothing but pain!

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:22.880
Wait, enjoying...?

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:28.250
So that's it.

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:31.540
I've figured it all out!

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:35.040
The reason you asked me out here
was to tease me, obviously!

00:12:38.330 --> 00:12:39.500
Wha?!

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:44.040
D-did I get it wrong?

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:47.830
I'm not sure that counts.

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:50.710
You only got it half right, which means you're half wrong.

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:52.540
Half wrong...?

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:54.790
Maybe I should pat you with half my strength.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:58.210
No, stop! Let's call it good! I mean, I was half right!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.330
Okay, then I won't.

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:04.000
You better be serious!

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.710
Sure. I won't touch your back.

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:07.170
Really?

00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:10.960
I said that I wouldn't lie to you, didn't I?

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:15.210
Okay... but then that whole competition was pointless.

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:16.630
Good point.

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:22.920
Tell me. What half did I get wrong, exactly?

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:26.580
I'd say the real answer is more
straightforward than yours.

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:28.500
Straightforward?

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:32.790
Plus, we've been doing what
I wanted to do this whole time.

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:35.130
This whole time...?

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.790
Hold on, that means...

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:43.750
She just wanted to see me?!

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:45.330
Did you figure out the answer?

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:47.420
Nope! I dunno!

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:49.630
As if I could say it out loud!

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:51.210
Really?

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:52.790
Y-yeah.

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:54.790
Nothing sprung to mind at all?

00:13:55.130 --> 00:13:56.630
Absolutely not!

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:03.710
I wish that you'd show up in my dreams sometime.

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:05.960
Then even when I'm asleep...

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:10.580
I can keep teasing you.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:16.290
Get this.

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:16.670
Yeah?

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:19.540
My mom made me pull the weeds yesterday.

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:19.880
Yeah?

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:22.670
And now my back looks like this!

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:23.750
So lame!

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:27.000
I'll do you one better, I used this tape on my body and...

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:30.670
Check it!

00:14:30.670 --> 00:14:34.540
I can look like a gentleman
even on the hottest days now!

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:37.790
That's depressing.

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:40.920
Our lives... are so empty.

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:44.750
Oh no!

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:46.540
I got a tan!

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:48.330
This is bad! So bad!

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:51.670
Yukari-chan, you're freaking out way too much about this.

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:53.750
Ultraviolet rays are our skin's worst enemy!

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:56.290
If you don't care for it properly
after prolonged exposure...

00:14:57.080 --> 00:15:00.290
You'll end up with wrinkles out
the wazoo before you know it!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.710
How horrifying!

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:05.500
Well, during summer break,

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:09.750
I was outside pretty much all the time either
walking the dog or working in the yard.

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:12.000
I was outside for club practice every day.

00:15:12.420 --> 00:15:13.500
That means...

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.500
We're all gonna be grandmas together!

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:19.040
NOOOOOOOO!

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:20.580
Okay.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:24.460
We're going to use everything that's good for
your skin to make homemade facial masks.

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:26.670
<b>Rhinoceros Beetle</b>

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:26.580
First, we'll start with some yogurt.

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:32.210
I feel it! It's working!

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:33.540
Probably.

00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:35.460
C'mon, you two should join...

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.750
Hey! That's not for the rhinoceros beetle to eat!

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:41.710
You're supposed to thinly slice the cucumbers like this.

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:43.540
Then put them on your face.

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:46.080
Does that really do anything?

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:47.710
Hey, did you know?

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:51.670
If you coat a cucumber in honey
it apparently tastes like a melon!

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:56.170
Open wide, Yukari-chan!

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:57.880
Huh?! Why me?

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:59.000
Say "ahhh"!

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:01.670
Ahhh.

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:05.460
How is it? What's it taste like?

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:06.830
Is it melon flavor?

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.040
O-oh my gosh!

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:11.080
What is it?!

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:15.960
It tastes like a cucumber dipped in honey.

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:18.830
Booooring.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.790
You can't go wrong putting honey on yogurt.

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:28.630
Stop! You're ruining my facial mask!

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:33.380
<b>New Semester</b>

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:32.670
New semester!

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:37.380
Good morning, Nishikata!

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:38.880
G'morning.

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:41.250
The new semester starts today.

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:41.830
Yep.

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:46.790
Oh hey.

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:49.170
There's something I wanted to show you, Takagi-san.

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:52.920
You're in for it now, Takagi-san!

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:57.290
Do you know what this is?

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:58.170
Oh jeez, another jack-in-the-box?
Do you know what this is?<b></b>

00:16:58.170 --> 00:16:59.920
Oh jeez, another jack-in-the-box?

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:03.290
I hope you didn't spend all your time making
that instead of doing your summer homework.

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:06.460
Guess that's exactly what you did.

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:11.580
Go ahead and laugh while you have the chance.

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:15.880
Because this here is my
"Jack-in-the-box version: Jurassic"!

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:18.630
And it's on a totally different level
than anything I made before!

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:20.170
Oh?

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:22.790
I wonder what's waiting inside.

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:27.580
Well, it's more than just paper and cotton this time...

00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:29.210
So, it's got a dinosaur inside.

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:30.250
WHAT?!

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:32.290
HOW'D YOU KNOW?!

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:35.250
I mean, you basically just said it yourself.

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:37.630
Calling it the "Jack-in-the-box version: Jurassic".

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:40.710
Wait, does "Jurassic" mean dinosaur or something?

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:45.880
I guess you didn't know that's the
time period the dinosaurs lived in.

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:49.420
<b>Jurassic: Big Dinos</b>

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:52.460
Well, it kinda reminded me of
dinosaurs and sounded cool, so...

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:55.540
That's just like you.

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:58.250
W-whatever!

00:17:58.250 --> 00:18:02.290
It doesn't matter if you know what's inside,
because it's still amazing!

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:03.630
It's gonna knock your socks off!

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:04.630
Wow.

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:07.040
Okay. If I open this box and say...

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:08.000
Whoa!

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:11.830
It'll be your win for surprising me.

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:13.000
WHOA!

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:17.170
If I don't make that sound, then it means I'm the winner.
Sound good?

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:19.130
F-fine by me!

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:21.210
Challenge accepted!

00:18:21.670 --> 00:18:24.250
If I win, then you have to buy me a soda.

00:18:24.250 --> 00:18:25.710
S-sure thing.

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:26.880
Alrighty then.

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:30.710
WHOA!

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:33.920
Hah. I haven't opened it yet.

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:54.380
Whoa!

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:56.790
Yahoo! I win this time!

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:58.630
I lost...

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.380
But it's not over yet!

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:10.460
How's it feel, Takagi-san?

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:12.040
It must be frustrating to lose!

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:18.920
We got the chance to see fireworks together.

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:04.420
Takagi-san...

00:20:07.630 --> 00:20:08.380
I...

00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:58.460
I hope he'll say it to me for real someday.

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:10.580
Good morning, Nishikata!

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:11.790
G'morning.

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:15.960
Today's the start of the new semester.

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:17.920
That's right.

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:23.630
Actually, I prepared a nice little present
for you to celebrate the new semester.

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:25.920
Let me guess.

00:21:26.210 --> 00:21:27.380
A jack-in-the-box?

00:21:33.170 --> 00:21:36.380
I skipped out on doing my homework to make this!

00:21:42.460 --> 00:21:45.710
Since I guessed what it was, that makes me the winner.

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:48.630
It wasn't really a competition...

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:51.080
Now we're even.

00:21:54.130 --> 00:21:57.210
I'll never have to admit that I lost to you in my dreams.

00:21:58.540 --> 00:21:59.250
Huh?

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:00.670
Wha?

00:22:05.210 --> 00:22:08.250
What's so funny? Takagi-san? Huh?
